n\",\"text\":\"Purchase Wishing Lantern (2,250 gold) as item 4 in the Frontline Burn Lantern build for Valir.\",\"url\":\"https://mlbbhub.com/heroes/valir#build-frontline-burn-lantern\"},{\"@type\":\"HowToStep\",\"position\":5,\"name\":\"Buy Divine Glaive\",\"text\":\"Purchase Divine Glaive (1,970 gold) as item 5 in the Frontline Burn Lantern build for Valir.\",\"url\":\"https://mlbbhub.com/heroes/valir#build-frontline-burn-lantern\"},{\"@type\":\"HowToStep\",\"position\":6,\"name\":\"Buy Holy Crystal\",\"text\":\"Purchase Holy Crystal (3,000 gold) as item 6 in the Frontline Burn Lantern build for Valir.\",\"url\":\"https://mlbbhub.com/heroes/valir#build-frontline-burn-lantern\"}],\"mainEntityOfPage\":{\"@type\":\"WebPage\",\"@id\":\"https://mlbbhub.com/heroes/valir\"},\"datePublished\":\"2026-04-20T00:00:00.000Z\",\"dateModified\":\"2026-05-13T00:00:00.000Z\",\"author\":{\"@type\":\"Organization\",\"name\":\"MLBBHub\",\"url\":\"https://mlbbhub.com\"}}5f:[\"$\",\"script\",\"1\",{\"type\":\"application/ld+json\",\"dangerouslySetInnerHTML\":{\"__html\":\"$63\"}}]\n64:T8f7,{\"@context\":\"https://schema.org\",\"@type\":\"HowTo\",\"name\":\"How to Build Valir in Mobile Legends: Anti-Dive Utility\",\"description\":\"Defensive utility build for assassin, hard-engage, or chain-control games where Valir's job is to live through the first commit and keep marking targets for allies.\",\"totalTime\":\"PT15M\",\"supply\":[{\"@type\":\"HowToSupply\",\"name\":\"Tough Boots\"},{\"@type\":\"HowToSupply\",\"name\":\"Glowing Wand\"},{\"@type\":\"HowToSupply\",\"name\":\"Ice Queen Wand\"},{\"@type\":\"HowToSupply\",\"name\":\"Winter Crown\"},{\"@type\":\"HowToSupply\",\"name\":\"Divine Glaive\"},{\"@type\":\"HowToSupply\",\"name\":\"Immortality\"}],\"tool\":[{\"@type\":\"HowToTool\",\"name\":\"Support Emblem\"},{\"@type\":\"HowToTool\",\"name\":\"Flicker Battle Spell\"}],\"step\":[{\"@type\":\"HowToStep\",\"position\":1,\"name\":\"Buy Tough Boots\",\"text\":\"Purchase Tough Boots (700 gold) as item 1 in the Anti-Dive Utility build for Valir.\",\"url\":\"https://mlbbhub.com/heroes/valir#build-anti-dive-utility\"},{\"@type\":\"HowToStep\",\"position\":2,\"name\":\"Buy Glowing Wand\",\"text\":\"Purchase Glowing Wand (2,050 gold) as item 2 in the Anti-Dive Utility build for Valir.\",\"url\":\"https://mlbbhub.com/heroes/valir#build-anti-dive-utility\"},{\"@type\":\"HowToStep\",\"position\":3,\"name\":\"Buy Ice Queen Wand\",\"text\":\"Purchase Ice Queen Wand (2,040 gold) as item 3 in the Anti-Dive Utility build for Valir.\",\"url\":\"https://mlbbhub.com/heroes/valir#build-anti-dive-utility\"},{\"@type\":\"HowToStep\",\"position\":4,\"name\":\"Buy Winter Crown\",\"text\":\"Purchase Winter Crown (1,910 gold) as item 4 in the Anti-Dive Utility build for Valir.\",\"url\":\"https://mlbbhub.com/heroes/valir#build-anti-dive-utility\"},{\"@type\":\"HowToStep\",\"position\":5,\"name\":\"Buy Divine Glaive\",\"text\":\"Purchase Divine Glaive (1,970 gold) as item 5 in the Anti-Dive Utility build for Valir.\",\"url\":\"https://mlbbhub.com/heroes/valir#build-anti-dive-utility\"},{\"@type\":\"HowToStep\",\"position\":6,\"name\":\"Buy Immortality\",\"text\":\"Purchase Immortality (2,120 gold) as item 6 in the Anti-Dive Utility build for Valir.\",\"url\":\"https://mlbbhub.com/heroes/valir#build-anti-dive-utility\"}],\"mainEntityOfPage\":{\"@type\":\"WebPage\",\"@id\":\"https://mlbbhub.com/heroes/valir\"},\"datePublished\":\"2026-04-20T00:00:00.000Z\",\"dateModified\":\"2026-05-13T00:00:00.000Z\",\"author\":{\"@type\":\"Organization\",\"name\":\"MLBBHub\",\"url\":\"https://mlbbhub.com\"}}60:[\"$\",\"script\",\"2\",{\"type\":\"application/ld+json\",\"dangerouslySetInnerHTML\":{\"__html\":\"$64\"}}]\n61:[\"$\",\"$L65\",null,{\"hero\":{\"id\":57,\"name\":\"Valir\",\"slug\":\"valir\",\"title\":\"Son of Flames\",\"role\":[\"Mage\"],\"specialty\":[\"Damage\",\"Guard\"],\"lane\":[\"Mid\"],\"tier\":\"S\",\"difficulty\":1,\"releaseYear\":2018,\"stats\":{\"durability\":20,\"offense\":70,\"controlEffect\":70,\"difficulty\":20},\"winRate\":53.85,\"pickRate\":1.03,\"banRate\":2.17,\"counters\":{\"strongAgainst\":[{\"heroSlug\":\"balmond\",\"heroName\":\"Balmond\",\"advantage\":\"strong\",\"tip\":\"Valir excels in both sustained damage and Crowd Control. He counters heroes lacking mobility like Balmond and Fredrinn.\"},{\"heroSlug\":\"fredrinn\",\"heroName\":\"Fredrinn\",\"advantage\":\"strong\",\"tip\":\"Valir excels in both sustained damage and Crowd Control. He counters heroes lacking mobility like Balmond and Fredrinn.\"}],\"weakAgainst\":[{\"heroSlug\":\"lancelot\",\"heroName\":\"Lancelot\",\"advantage\":\"weak\",\"tip\":\"Valir is countered by agile Assassins like Lancelot and Fanny because they can easily evade his 1st Skill.\"},{\"heroSlug\":\"fanny\",\"heroName\":\"Fanny\",\"advantage\":\"weak\",\"tip\":\"Valir is countered by agile Assassins like Lancelot and Fanny because they can easily evade his 1st Skill.\"}]},\"splashArt\":\"https://akmweb.youngjoygame.com/web/svnres/file/mlbb/homepage/100_7a285a7d75ceb5fecceec6b2608b232f.jpg\",\"portrait\":\"https://akmweb.youngjoygame.com/web/svnres/img/test/homepage_2_2_16_1232_1/100_bf16690876761b80822df90eb3320d69.png\",\"officialMatchups\":[{\"kind\":\"best_ally\",\"heroId\":\"36\",\"heroName\":\"Aurora\",\"heroSlug\":\"aurora\",\"icon\":\"https://akmweb.youngjoygame.com/web/madmin/image/737f20a2934bbae1c5fd1b129dcbe066.jpg?w=200-200-fefefe\",\"tip\":\"With Aurora using Coldness Destroy to freeze enemies, Valir can maximize his damage output.\"},{\"kind\":\"counters\",\"heroId\":\"52\",\"heroName\":\"Pharsa\",\"heroSlug\":\"pharsa\",\"icon\":\"https://akmwebstatic.yuanzhanapp.com/web/madmin/image_212e59ee7c8490397278ba68c8063a19.png\",\"tip\":\"Valir's Searing Torrent can completely restrain Pharsa's Feathered Air Strike, preventing her from maintaining sustained damage.\"},{\"kind\":\"countered_by\",\"heroId\":\"8\",\"heroName\":\"Karina\",\"heroSlug\":\"karina\",\"icon\":\"https://akmweb.youngjoygame.com/web/madmin/image/1691dbbde8237768590768a90510d5a6.jpg?w=100-100-f7fcc4\",\"tip\":\"Because Valir lacks life-saving skills, it's hard for him to handle assassins with multi-stage dash skills.\"}],\"skills\":{\"skills\":[{\"name\":\"Ashing\",\"type\":\"Passive\",\"description\":\"Valir's skills apply a stack of Ablaze to enemies hit, dealing them Magic Damage equal to 1 (+0.2% Total Magic Power)% of their Max HP per second for 3s.\\n\\nAt 3 stacks, the fire detonates, dealing Magic Damage equal to 5 (+1% Total Magic Power)% of the target's Max HP and stunning them for 1s.\\nA target can only be stunned by Valir's skills once every 7s.\",\"descriptionRich\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"Valir's skills apply a stack of \"},{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"Ablaze\",\"color\":\"#a6aafb\"},{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\" to enemies hit, dealing them Magic Damage equal to 1\"},{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\" (+0.2% Total Magic Power)\",\"color\":\"#62f8fe\"},{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"% of their Max HP per second for 3s.\\n\\nAt 3 stacks, the fire detonates, dealing Magic Damage equal to 5\"},{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\" (+1% Total Magic Power)\",\"color\":\"#62f8fe\"},{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"% of the target's Max HP and stunning them for 1s.\\nA target can only be stunned by Valir's skills once every 7s.\"}],\"cooldown\":null,\"manaCost\":null,\"icon\":\"https://akmweb.youngjoygame.com/web/svnres/img/test/homepage_2_2_16_1232_1/100_65b74c606ad3b8d47f18b6f87bc25bee.png\",\"tags\":[\"CC\",\"Damage\"]},{\"name\":\"Burst Fireball\",\"type\":\"Skill 1\",\"description\":\"Valir launches a fireball that explodes upon hitting the first target, dealing 235 (+80% Total Magic Power) Magic Damage and slowing them by 30% for 1s. The flame on the ground explodes after 1s, dealing 118 (+40% Total Magic Power) Magic Damage.\\n\\nValir recharges 1 fireball every 9s (up to 2 charges). Hitting an enemy hero or legend creep with this skill immediately restores 1 charge, while hitting a minion restores 4s of the recharge time.\\n\\nVengeance Flame: Increases the cast range of Burst Fireball by 30%.\",\"descriptionRich\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"Valir launches a fireball that explodes upon hitting the first target, dealing 235\"},{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\" (+80% Total Magic Power)\",\"color\":\"#62f8fe\"},{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\" Magic Damage and slowing them by 30% for 1s. The flame on the ground explodes after 1s, dealing 118\"},{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\" (+40% Total Magic Power)\",\"color\":\"#62f8fe\"},{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\" Magic Damage.\\n\\nValir recharges 1 fireball every 9s (up to 2 charges). Hitting an enemy hero or legend creep with this skill immediately restores 1 charge, while hitting a minion restores 4s of the recharge time.\\n\\n\"},{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"Vengeance Flame\",\"color\":\"#a6aafb\"},{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\": Increases the cast range of \"},{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"Burst Fireball\",\"color\":\"#a6aafb\"},{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\" by 30%.\"}],\"cooldown\":\"1.5s\",\"manaCost\":\"45\",\"icon\":\"https://akmweb.youngjoygame.com/web/svnres/img/test/homepage_2_2_16_1232_1/100_37f8cc042e3430f6afcf4a18e1c8d064.png\",\"tags\":[\"AOE\",\"Slow\"]},{\"name\":\"Searing Torrent\",\"type\":\"Skill 2\",\"description\":\"Valir unleashes a torrent of flames in the target direction, dealing 200 (+60% Total Magic Power) Magic Damage and knocking them back to the end of its path.\\n\\nVengeance Flame: The torrent forms a firewall at the end of its path that lasts 4s, dealing 100 (+30% Total Magic Power) Magic Damage to nearby enemies every 1s.\\n\\nEnemies hit by the torrent or the firewall are slowed by 25% for 1s.\",\"descriptionRich\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"Valir unleashes a torrent of flames in the target direction, dealing 200\"},{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\" (+60% Total Magic Power)\",\"color\":\"#62f8fe\"},{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\" Magic Damage and knocking them back to the end of its path.\\n\\n\"},{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"Vengeance Flame\",\"color\":\"#a6aafb\"},{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\": The torrent forms a firewall at the end of its path that lasts 4s, dealing 100\"},{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\" (+30% Total Magic Power)\",\"color\":\"#62f8fe\"},{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\" Magic Damage to nearby enemies every 1s.\\n\\nEnemies hit by the torrent or the firewall are slowed by 25% for 1s.\"}],\"cooldown\":\"13s\",\"manaCost\":\"75\",\"icon\":\"https://akmweb.youngjoygame.com/web/svnres/img/test/homepage_2_2_16_1232_1/100_d2289b367b7fb08328145563195346f6.png\",\"tags\":[\"CC\",\"AOE\"]},{\"name\":\"Vengeance Flame\",\"type\":\"Ultimate\",\"description\":\"Valir removes all debuffs on himself and gains 40% Movement Speed that decays over 3s. Meanwhile, he conjures 4 Vengeance Flames that enhance Burst Fireball and Searing Torrent for 9s.\",\"descriptionRich\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"Valir removes all debuffs on himself and gains 40% Movement Speed that decays over 3s. Meanwhile, he conjures 4 \"},{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"Vengeance Flames\",\"color\":\"#a6aafb\"},{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\" that enhance \"},{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"Burst Fireball\",\"color\":\"#a6aafb\"},{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\" and \"},{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"Searing Torrent\",\"color\":\"#a6aafb\"},{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\" for 9s.\"}],\"cooldown\":\"36s\",\"manaCost\":\"100\",\"icon\":\"https://akmweb.youngjoygame.com/web/svnres/img/test/homepage_2_2_16_1232_1/100_87bb3708c7ffb7391a768de2c82370a7.png\",\"tags\":[\"Remove CC\",\"Buff\"]}],\"skillUpgradePriority\":\"3-1-2\",\"skillPriorityTip\":\"Max 1st skill first.\\nFlicker - This is Valir's only life-saving skill.\",\"skillPriorityTipRich\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"Max 1st skill first.\"},{\"type\":\"lineBreak\"},{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"Flicker - This is Valir's only life-saving skill. \"}]},\"synergies\":[{\"heroSlug\":\"khaleed\",\"heroName\":\"Khaleed\",\"synergyScore\":8,\"reason\":\"Teaming up with Fighters with strong initiation like Khaleed and Yu Zhong can simultaneously enhance the entire team's combat potential.\"},{\"heroSlug\":\"yu-zhong\",\"heroName\":\"Yu Zhong\",\"synergyScore\":8,\"reason\":\"Teaming up with Fighters with strong initiation like Khaleed and Yu Zhong can simultaneously enhance the entire team's combat potential.\"}],\"combos\":[{\"type\":\"teamfight\",\"title\":\"TEAMFIGHT COMBOS\",\"description\":\"In teamfights, activate Valir's Ultimate to enhance his skills, then blast the enemy with his 1st Skill. If the enemy tries to get close, use his 2nd Skill to push them away, and hit them with his 1st Skill for high damage.\",\"skillSequence\":[{\"skillId\":5730,\"skillIcon\":\"https://akmweb.youngjoygame.com/web/svnres/img/test/homepage_2_2_16_1232_1/100_87bb3708c7ffb7391a768de2c82370a7.png\"},{\"skillId\":5710,\"skillIcon\":\"https://akmweb.youngjoygame.com/web/svnres/img/test/homepage_2_2_16_1232_1/100_37f8cc042e3430f6afcf4a18e1c8d064.png\"},{\"skillId\":5710,\"skillIcon\":\"https://akmweb.youngjoygame.com/web/svnres/img/test/homepage_2_2_16_1232_1/100_37f8cc042e3430f6afcf4a18e1c8d064.png\"},{\"skillId\":5720,\"skillIcon\":\"https://akmweb.youngjoygame.com/web/svnres/img/test/homepage_2_2_16_1232_1/100_d2289b367b7fb08328145563195346f6.png\"},{\"skillId\":5710,\"skillIcon\":\"https://akmweb.youngjoygame.com/web/svnres/img/test/homepage_2_2_16_1232_1/100_37f8cc042e3430f6afcf4a18e1c8d064.png\"}]},{\"type\":\"laning\",\"title\":\"LANING COMBOS\",\"description\":\"In the laning phase, harass enemies with Valir's 1st Skill\\r\\nuntil their HP is low, then cast his 2nd Skill to push them back and follow up immediately with his 1st Skill for burst damage.\",\"skillSequence\":[{\"skillId\":5710,\"skillIcon\":\"https://akmweb.youngjoygame.com/web/svnres/img/test/homepage_2_2_16_1232_1/100_37f8cc042e3430f6afcf4a18e1c8d064.png\"},{\"skillId\":5720,\"skillIcon\":\"https://akmweb.youngjoygame.com/web/svnres/img/test/homepage_2_2_16_1232_1/100_d2289b367b7fb08328145563195346f6.png\"},{\"skillId\":5710,\"skillIcon\":\"https://akmweb.youngjoygame.com/web/svnres/img/test/homepage_2_2_16_1232_1/100_37f8cc042e3430f6afcf4a18e1c8d064.png\"}]}],\"metaDescription\":\"Valir build, counter, and emblem guide for Mobile Legends. Learn his Glowing + Ice Queen spike, draft rules, peel angles, and anti-dive item timing in mid lane.\",\"builds\":[],\"overviewLede\":\"Valir is not a burst mage with a self-peel button. He is a bouncer who turns one corridor of the fight into a bad place to exist. The pick works when the enemy must walk through him to play the game, and it fails when the enemy can ignore that corridor and land on his face anyway.\"},\"serverLocale\":\"en\",\"curatedBuilds\":{\"source\":\"curated\",\"hero\":\"valir\",\"patch\":\"2.1.67\",\"lastReviewed\":\"2026-05-13\",\"stalePatch\":true,\"currentPatch\":\"2.2.16a\",\"builds\":[{\"slot\":1,\"id\":\"mid-control-default\",\"name\":\"Mid Control Default\",\"roleContext\":\"Mid\",\"items\":[{\"slug\":\"demon-boots\",\"name\":\"Demon Boots\",\"cost\":720,\"fixed\":false},{\"slug\":\"glowing-wand\",\"name\":\"Glowing Wand\",\"cost\":2050,\"fixed\":false},{\"slug\":\"ice-queen-wand\",\"name\":\"Ice Queen Wand\",\"cost\":2040,\"fixed\":false},{\"slug\":\"genius-wand\",\"name\":\"Genius Wand\",\"cost\":2000,\"fixed\":false},{\"slug\":\"divine-glaive\",\"name\":\"Divine Glaive\",\"cost\":1970,\"fixed\":false},{\"slug\":\"immortality\",\"name\":\"Immortality\",\"cost\":2120,\"fixed\":false}],\"coreItems\":[{\"slug\":\"glowing-wand\",\"name\":\"Glowing Wand\"},{\"slug\":\"ice-queen-wand\",\"name\":\"Ice Queen Wand\"},{\"slug\":\"genius-wand\",\"name\":\"Genius Wand\"}],\"emblem\":{\"slug\":\"mage\",\"name\":\"Mage Emblem\",\"talents\":[{\"slug\":\"inspire\",\"name\":\"Inspire\",\"iconUrl\":\"/images/talents/inspire.png\",\"bucket\":\"standard\"},{\"slug\":\"bargain-hunter\",\"name\":\"Bargain Hunter\",\"