p-2.5 text-sm md:text-base font-heading font-semibold text-text-primary uppercase tracking-[0.06em]\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"span\",null,{\"className\":\"inline-block rounded-sm px-2 py-0.5 text-[10px] font-bold tracking-[0.16em] self-center\",\"style\":{\"color\":\"#4dc9f6\",\"background\":\"#4dc9f61a\",\"border\":\"1px solid #4dc9f640\"},\"children\":\"Legend\"}],[\"$\",\"span\",null,{\"children\":[\"$\",\"$L4c\",null,{\"k\":\"pages.heroes.rankCardH3\",\"params\":{\"name\":\"Valir\",\"rank\":\"Legend\"}}]}]]}],[\"$\",\"$L40\",null,{\"href\":\"/tier-list?rank=legend\",\"prefetch\":false,\"className\":\"text-[11px] font-heading uppercase tracking-[0.18em] text-text-accent hover:text-text-accent-bright transition-colors\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"$L4c\",null,{\"k\":\"pages.heroes.rankTierListLink\",\"params\":{\"rank\":\"Legend\"}}],\" →\"]}]]}],[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"className\":\"text-text-muted text-[13px] leading-relaxed\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"$L4c\",null,{\"k\":\"pages.heroes.rankSentenceLead\",\"params\":{\"rank\":\"Legend\",\"name\":\"Valir\"}}],[\"$\",\"strong\",null,{\"className\":\"text-text-primary\",\"children\":[\"54.40\",\"%\"]}],[\"$\",\"$L4c\",null,{\"k\":\"pages.heroes.rankSentenceMid1\",\"params\":{\"name\":\"Valir\",\"delta\":\"+0.26%\"}}],[\"$\",\"strong\",null,{\"className\":\"text-text-primary\",\"children\":[\"1.07\",\"%\"]}],[\"$\",\"$L4c\",null,{\"k\":\"pages.heroes.rankSentenceMid2\"}],[\"$\",\"strong\",null,{\"className\":\"text-text-primary\",\"children\":[\"2.84\",\"%\"]}],[\"$\",\"$L4c\",null,{\"k\":\"pages.heroes.rankSentenceAfter\",\"params\":{\"rank\":\"Legend\"}}]]}]]}],[\"$\",\"article\",\"mythic\",{\"className\":\"group relative min-w-0 border border-mlbb-gold/15 bg-surface-1/40 p-3.5 pl-5 md:p-4 md:pl-6 transition-colors hover:border-mlbb-gold/30\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"span\",null,{\"aria-hidden\":\"true\",\"className\":\"absolute left-0 top-0 bottom-0 w-[3px]\",\"style\":{\"background\":\"linear-gradient(to bottom, #f59e0b, #f59e0b33)\",\"boxShadow\":\"0 0 12px -2px #f59e0b80\"}}],\"$La2\",\"$La3\"]}],\"$La4\",\"$La5\"]}]\n7e:[\"$\",\"p\",\"p-2\",{\"className\":\"text-[#9BA0B4] leading-relaxed mb-4 text-[15px]\",\"children\":[\"Do not blind-pick him into suppression or layered flank pressure. \",[\"$\",\"$L40\",\"a-0\",{\"href\":\"/heroes/franco\",\"prefetch\":false,\"className\":\"text-[#C8AA6E] hover:text-[#F0D060] underline decoration-[#C8AA6E]/40 hover:decoration-[#F0D060] transition-colors\",\"children\":\"Franco\"}],\" suppresses and that is the one CC Valir's cleanse cannot remove. The revamped \",[\"$\",\"$L40\",\"a-1\",{\"href\":\"/heroes/kaja\",\"prefetch\":false,\"className\":\"text-[#C8AA6E] hover:text-[#F0D060] underline decoration-[#C8AA6E]/40 hover:decoration-[#F0D060] transition-colors\",\"children\":\"Kaja\"}],\" is still a counter, just not through suppression: his Divine Binding locks a whole area and drags everyone inside, and Valir has no dash to escape the circle once it lands. \",[\"$\",\"$L40\",\"a-2\",{\"href\":\"/heroes/hayabusa\",\"prefetch\":false,\"className\":\"text-[#C8AA6E] hover:text-[#F0D060] underline decoration-[#C8AA6E]/40 hover:decoration-[#F0D060] transition-colors\",\"children\":\"Hayabusa\"}],\", \",[\"$\",\"$L40\",\"a-3\",{\"href\":\"/heroes/natalia\",\"prefetch\":false,\"className\":\"text-[#C8AA6E] hover:text-[#F0D060] underline decoration-[#C8AA6E]/40 hover:decoration-[#F0D060] transition-colors\",\"children\":\"Natalia\"}],\", and \",[\"$\",\"$L40\",\"a-4\",{\"href\":\"/heroes/helcurt\",\"prefetch\":false,\"className\":\"text-[#C8AA6E] hover:text-[#F0D060] underline decoration-[#C8AA6E]/40 hover:decoration-[#F0D060] transition-colors\",\"children\":\"Helcurt\"}],\" do not care that the front door is on fire because they do not use the front door. \",[\"$\",\"$L40\",\"a-5\",{\"href\":\"/heroes/lolita\",\"prefetch\":false,\"className\":\"text-[#C8AA6E] hover:text-[#F0D060] underline decoration-[#C8AA6E]/40 hover:decoration-[#F0D060] transition-colors\",\"children\":\"Lolita\"}],\" is also miserable because she changes your fireball lane into dead time and forces you to hold skills instead of shaping space.\"]}]\n7f:[\"$\",\"p\",\"p-3\",{\"className\":\"text-[#9BA0B4] leading-relaxed mb-4 text-[15px]\",\"children\":\"The clean way to think about the pick is simple: if the enemy must run at your team, Valir is one of the best punish mages in the role. If the enemy can jump past your zone or lock you with suppression, you are drafting a lane bully into the wrong game.\"}]\n80:[\"$\",\"h2\",\"h2-1\",{\"className\":\"text-xl md:text-[26px] font-heading font-bold text-[#F0D060] mt-10 mb-4 first:mt-0 text-balance uppercase tracking-[0.04em] leading-tight relative\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"span\",null,{\"aria-hidden\":\"true\",\"className\":\"block w-10 h-[3px] bg-gradient-to-r from-[#F0D060] to-[#C8AA6E]/0 mb-3\"}],\"The one thing that actually makes Valir work\"]}]\n81:[\"$\",\"p\",\"p-4\",{\"className\":\"text-[#9BA0B4] leading-relaxed mb-4 text-[15px]\",\"children\":\"Valir is not scary because of one combo. He is scary because he decides where the fight starts.\"}]\n82:[\"$\",\"p\",\"p-5\",{\"className\":\"text-[#9BA0B4] leading-relaxed mb-4 text-[15px]\",\"children\":\"Every part of the kit points at that job. Burst Fireball is not there to fish for highlight kills. It is there to keep one charge cycling while the other threatens the third passive stack. Searing Torrent is not a damage spell first. It is the line that tells divers, tanks, and bruisers to start over from farther away than they wanted. Vengeance Flame is not an \\\"I got caught\\\" panic button. It is the permission slip that lets Valir keep controlling space even after the enemy finally reaches him.\"}]\n83:[\"$\",\"p\",\"p-6\",{\"className\":\"text-[#9BA0B4] leading-relaxed mb-4 text-[15px]\",\"children\":\"Once that clicks, the hero stops looking like a poke mage and starts looking like a traffic controller. You are not trying to delete the first target you see. You are trying to force the enemy team to enter the fight in the order you want. Tanks go first, then fighters hesitate, then the backline has no clean angle because the first two bodies already lost tempo. That is how Valir wins fights that look slow on the scoreboard and impossible in real time.\"}]\n84:[\"$\",\"p\",\"p-7\",{\"className\":\"text-[#9BA0B4] leading-relaxed mb-4 text-[15px]\",\"children\":\"The practical corollary is brutal: if you throw both fireball charges into empty space, or spend Torrent for chip damage, you have deleted the threat that makes the enemy respect you. Valir without zone pressure is just a mage with no blink.\"}]\n85:[\"$\",\"h2\",\"h2-2\",{\"className\":\"text-xl md:text-[26px] font-heading font-bold text-[#F0D060] mt-10 mb-4 first:mt-0 text-balance uppercase tracking-[0.04em] leading-tight relative\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"span\",null,{\"aria-hidden\":\"true\",\"className\":\"block w-10 h-[3px] bg-gradient-to-r from-[#F0D060] to-[#C8AA6E]/0 mb-3\"}],\"Mid lane: the first four minutes\"]}]\n86:[\"$\",\"p\",\"p-8\",{\"className\":\"text-[#9BA0B4] leading-relaxed mb-4 text-[15px]\",\"children\":\"Valir's lane is about owning the first move, not about solo-killing the opposing mid. Hit level 4 with wave control, one side bush warded by your body position, and your defensive tool still available.\"}]\n87:[\"$\",\"ol\",\"ol-0\",{\"className\":\"list-decimal list-inside text-[#9BA0B4] my-3 space-y-2 ml-2\",\"children\":[\"\\n\",[\"$\",\"li\",\"li-0\",{\"className\":\"text-[#9BA0B4]\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"strong\",\"strong-0\",{\"className\":\"text-[#E8E6E3] font-semibold\",\"children\":\"Start S1 and win the first shove from range.\"}],\" Use the first fireball on the caster line or the enemy mid if they step too high, then hold the second charge as a threat instead of instantly dumping it. The goal is to make the opponent respect the stun setup while you clear first and move first.\"]}],\"\\n\",[\"$\",\"li\",\"li-1\",{\"className\":\"text-[#9BA0B4]\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"strong\",\"strong-0\",{\"className\":\"text-[#E8E6E3] font-semibold\",\"children\":\"Treat S2 as anti-gank insurance, not lane poke.\"}],\" If the enemy roam is off-map and river vision is dark, do not cast Searing Torrent just to chunk the lane opponent. The spell matters more as the button that denies the first jungle step than as one extra trade spell.\"]}],\"\\n\",[\"$\",\"li\",\"li-2\",{\"className\":\"text-[#9BA0B4]\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"strong\",\"strong-0\",{\"className\":\"text-[#E8E6E3] font-semibold\",\"children\":\"Save battle-spell tempo for the first real rotation.\"}],\" If you took Flicker, keep it for the first Turtle fight or the first dive that actually reaches you. If you took Flameshot into a slow lobby, spend it only on a guaranteed kill or to finish a fight around river. Burning spell tempo for a cute lane clip is how Valir arrives to minute three with priority but no safety.\"]}],\"\\n\"]}]\n88:[\"$\",\"p\",\"p-9\",{\"className\":\"text-[#9BA0B4] leading-relaxed mb-4 text-[15px]\",\"children\":\"Your early roam pattern should be short and disciplined. Shove, show to the river entrance, threaten a fireball angle, then return if the side lane is not already committed. Valir is strong when he arrives second with wave done, not when he abandons mid first and gets collapsed in the jungle.\"}]\n89:[\"$\",\"h2\",\"h2-3\",{\"className\":\"text-xl md:text-[26px] font-heading font-bold text-[#F0D060] mt-10 mb-4 first:mt-0 text-balance uppercase tracking-[0.04em] leading-tight relative\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"span\",null,{\"aria-hidden\":\"true\",\"className\":\"block w-10 h-[3px] bg-gradient-to-r from-[#F0D060] to-[#C8AA6E]/0 mb-3\"}],\"The power spike you are farming toward\"]}]\n8a:[\"$\",\"p\",\"p-10\",{\"className\":\"text-[#9BA0B4] leading-relaxed mb-4 text-[15px]\",\"children\":[\"Valir's real two-item spike is \",[\"$\",\"strong\",\"strong-0\",{\"className\":\"text-[#E8E6E3] font-semibold\",\"children\":\"Glowing Wand plus Ice Queen Wand\"}],\", usually around the 7 to 9 minute window in a normal mid lane. That is the point where his damage-over-time control stops being annoying and starts being structurally unfair.\"]}]\n8b:[\"$\",\"p\",\"p-11\",{\"className\":\"text-[#9BA0B4] leading-relaxed mb-4 text-[15px]\",\"children\":\"Glowing Wand gives every repeated touch real health pressure and anti-heal. Ice Queen Wand makes every skill hit slow harder the longer the enemy stays in contact. Put those together with Valir's natural multi-hit pattern and something specific changes: one fireball is no longer just poke, and one enhanced Torrent is no longer just peel. They become a trap state. Anyone who keeps walking through the burn is getting slower, taking more chip, and healing less while your team repositions around them.\"}]\n8c:[\"$\",\"p\",\"p-12\",{\"className\":\"text-[#9BA0B4] leading-relaxed mb-4 text-[15px]\",\"children\":\"This is why Valir feels oppressive around second Turtle and the first Lord setup when he is on curve. Before those two items, he is mostly buying time. After those two items, he is deciding whether tanks can cross a choke without arriving half-spent. That is the moment you start forcing objective fights instead of merely answering them.\"}]\n8d:[\"$\",\"p\",\"p-13\",{\"className\":\"text-[#9BA0B4] leading-relaxed mb-4 text-[15px]\",\"children\":\"Do not mistake raw AP items for the first spike. Holy Crystal hits harder later, but it does not change the geometry of the fight. Glowing plus Ice Queen changes geometry. That is the point of the hero.\"}]\n8e:[\"$\",\"$La6\",null,{\"slot\":\"7246933188\",\"variant\":\"in-article\",\"className\":\"my-8\"}]\n8f:[[\"$\",\"h2\",\"h2-0\",{\"className\":\"text-xl md:text-[26px] font-heading font-bold text-[#F0D060] mt-10 mb-4 first:mt-0 text-balance uppercase tracking-[0.04em] leading-tight relative\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"span\",null,{\"aria-hidden\":\"true\",\"className\":\"block w-10 h-[3px] bg-gradient-to-r from-[#F0D060] to-[#C8AA6E]/0 mb-3\"}],\"Teamfight positioning and target priority\"]}],\"\\n\",[\"$\",\"p\",\"p-0\",{\"className\":\"text-[#9BA0B4] leading-relaxed mb-4 text-[15px]\",\"children\":\"The common Valir mistake is trying to play him like a long-range finisher who always looks for the enemy backline first. That reflex loses fights. Your first job is to break the enemy entry, not to prove that you can reach their marksman.\"}],\"\\n\",[\"$\",\"p\",\"p-1\",{\"className\":\"text-[#9BA0B4] leading-relaxed mb-4 text-[15px]\",\"children\":\"Three positioning rules matter every game:\"}],\"\\n\",[\"$\",\"ol\",\"ol-0\",{\"className\":\"list-decimal list-inside text-[#9BA0B4] my-3 space-y-2 ml-2\",\"children\":[\"\\n\",[\"$\",\"li\",\"li-0\",{\"className\":\"text-[#9BA0B4]\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"strong\",\"strong-0\",{\"className\":\"text-[#E8E6E3] font-semibold\",\"children\":\"Stand one layer behind your real frontliner, never at the mouth of the choke.\"}],\" If you stand on the doorway yourself, you become the target that eats the engage. Stand behind the doorway so Searing Torrent throws the diver back through the space they just spent resources to cross.\"]}],\"\\n\",[\"$\",\"li\",\"li-1\",{\"className\":\"text-[#9BA0B4]\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"strong\",\"strong-0\",{\"className\":\"text-[#E8E6E3] font-semibold\",\"children\":\"Hold one fireball charge for contact.\"}],\" Spending both S1 charges for poke removes the stun threat that keeps assassins and fighters honest. Valir with one charge loaded is a deterrent. Valir with zero is permission.\"]}],\"\\n\",[\"$\",\"li\",\"li-2\",{\"className\":\"text-[#9BA0B4]\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"strong\",\"strong-0\",{\"className\":\"text-[#E8E6E3] font-semibold\",\"children\":\"Peel the first body that commits, then turn forward.\"}],\" If \",[\"$\",\"$L40\",\"a-0\",{\"href\":\"/heroes/lapu-lapu\",\"prefetch\":false,\"className\":\"text-[#C8AA6E] hover:text-[#F0D060] underline decoration-[#C8AA6E]/40 hover:decoration-[#F0D060] transition-colors\",\"children\":\"Lapu-Lapu\"}],\", \",[\"$\",\"$L40\",\"a-1\",{\"href\":\"/heroes/khaleed\",\"prefetch\":false,\"className\":\"text-[#C8AA6E] hover:text-[#F0D060] underline decoration-[#C8AA6E]/40 hover:decoration-[#F0D060] transition-colors\",\"children\":\"Khaleed\"}],\", or \",[\"$\",\"$L40\",\"a-2\",{\"href\":\"/heroes/fredrinn\",\"prefetch\":false,\"className\":\"text-[#C8AA6E] hover:text-[#F0D060] underline decoration-[#C8AA6E]/40 hover:decoration-[#F0D060] transition-colors\",\"children\":\"Fredrinn\"}],\" steps in, hit that body first, stack passive, and make the engage fail. If you skip the diver to throw spells at the enemy marksman, you usually die with damage still available.\"]}],\"\\n\"]}],\"\\n\",[\"$\",\"p\",\"p-2\",{\"className\":\"text-[#9BA0B4] leading-relaxed mb-4 text-[15px]\",\"children\":\"Target priority changes only after the line is secure. Once the diver or tank has been pushed off, then you can walk up and keep fireballs on whoever got stranded behind them.\"}],\"\\n\",[\"$\",\"p\",\"p-3\",{\"className\":\"text-[#9BA0B4] leading-relaxed mb-4 text-[15px]\",\"children\":[\"If your support is \",[\"$\",\"$L40\",\"a-0\",{\"href\":\"/heroes/diggie\",\"prefetch\":false,\"className\":\"text-[#C8AA6E] hover:text-[#F0D060] underline decoration-[#C8AA6E]/40 hover:decoration-[#F0D060] transition-colors\",\"children\":\"Diggie\"}],\" or \",[\"$\",\"$L40\",\"a-1\",{\"href\":\"/heroes/mathilda\",\"prefetch\":false,\"className\":\"text-[#C8AA6E] hover:text-[#F0D060] underline decoration-[#C8AA6E]/40 hover:decoration-[#F0D060] transition-colors\",\"children\":\"Mathilda\"}],\", you can take a higher angle because they either deny the first commit or give you a reset path after it. If your support is \",\"$La7\",\" or \",\"$La8\",\", play tighter. Healing does not fix bad spacing against a hard flank.\"]}],\"\\n\",\"$La9\",\"\\n\",\"$Laa\",\"\\n\",\"$Lab\",\"\\n\",\"$Lac\",\"\\n\",\"$Lad\",\"\\n\",\"$Lae\",\"\\n\",\"$Laf\",\"\\n\",\"$Lb0\",\"\\n\",\"$Lb1\",\"\\n\",\"$Lb2\",\"\\n\",\"$Lb3\",\"\\n\",\"$Lb4\",\"\\n\",\"$Lb5\",\"\\n\",\"$Lb6\",\"\\n\",\"$Lb7\",\"\\n\",\"$Lb8\",\"\\n\",\"$Lb9\",\"\\n\",\"$Lba\"]\n90:[\"$\",\"$Lbb\",null,{\"heroName\":\"Valir\"}]\n"])</script><script>self.__next_f.push([1,"91:[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"relative bg-surface-4 border border-mlbb-gold/20 overflow-hidden card-hover hover:border-mlbb-gold/50\",\"style\":{\"boxShadow\":\"0 2px 8px rgba(0,0,0,0.3)\"},\"children\":[[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"flex items-center gap-3 p-3\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"relative w-14 h-14 rounded-full overflow-hidden flex-shrink-0 bg-surface-3\",\"children\":[\"$\",\"$L6b\",null,{\"src\":\"https://akmweb.youngjoygame.com/web/svnres/img/test/homepage_2_2_16_1232_1/100_68277dce415742c4a98883151c693a07.png\",\"alt\":\"Rafaela - Wings of Holiness\",\"unoptimized\":false,\"priority\":\"$undefined\",\"fetchPriority\":\"$undefined\",\"fill\":true,\"className\":\"object-cover group-hover:scale-110 transition-transform duration-300\",\"sizes\":\"56px\",\"placeholder\":\"blur\",\"blurDataURL\":\"data:image/svg+xml;base64,PHN2ZyB3aWR0aD0iMTAwIiBoZWlnaHQ9IjEwMCIgeG1sbnM9Imh0dHA6Ly93d3cudzMub3JnLzIwMDAvc3ZnIj48cmVjdCB3aWR0aD0iMTAwIiBoZWlnaHQ9IjEwMCIgZmlsbD0iIzBkMTIyNSIvPjwvc3ZnPg==\"}]}],[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"flex-1 min-w-0\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"h4\",null,{\"className\":\"font-heading font-bold text-text-primary group-hover:text-text-accent-bright transition-colors truncate\",\"children\":\"Rafaela\"}],[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"flex items-center gap-2 mt-0.5\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"span\",null,{\"className\":\"text-[10px] font-heading uppercase tracking-wider px-1.5 py-0.5\",\"style\":{\"backgroundColor\":\"#2ECC7120\",\"color\":\"#6ddb9c\",\"border\":\"1px solid #2ECC7140\"},\"children\":\"Support\"}],[\"$\",\"$L6c\",null,{\"tier\":\"S\",\"size\":\"sm\"}]]}],[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"className\":\"text-[10px] text-text-muted mt-1 truncate\",\"children\":[\"$\",\"$L4c\",null,{\"k\":\"pages.heroes.relReasonCounter\",\"params\":{\"pp\":\"3.3\",\"name\":\"Valir\"}}]}]]}],[\"$\",\"svg\",null,{\"ref\":\"$undefined\",\"xmlns\":\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\",\"width\":24,\"height\":24,\"viewBox\":\"0 0 24 24\",\"fill\":\"none\",\"stroke\":\"currentColor\",\"strokeWidth\":2,\"strokeLinecap\":\"round\",\"strokeLinejoin\":\"round\",\"className\":\"lucide lucide-chevron-right w-4 h-4 text-text-muted group-hover:text-text-accent transition-colors flex-shrink-0\",\"aria-hidden\":\"true\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"path\",\"mthhwq\",{\"d\":\"m9 18 6-6-6-6\"}],\"$undefined\"]}]]}],[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"absolute inset-0 opacity-0 group-hover:opacity-100 transition-opacity duration-300 pointer-events-none\",\"style\":{\"background\":\"radial-gradient(ellipse at center, #2ECC7112 0%, transparent 70%)\"}}],[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"absolute top-0 left-0 w-3 h-3 border-t border-l border-mlbb-gold/0 group-hover:border-mlbb-gold/50 transition-all duration-300 pointer-events-none\"}],[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"absolute bottom-0 right-0 w-3 h-3 border-b border-r border-mlbb-gold/0 group-hover:border-mlbb-gold/50 transition-all duration-300 pointer-events-none\"}],[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"absolute bottom-0 left-0 right-0 h-[1px] opacity-0 group-hover:opacity-100 transition-opacity duration-300 pointer-events-none\",\"style\":{\"background\":\"linear-gradient(90deg, transparent, #2ECC71, transparent)\"}}]]}]\n92:[\"$\",\"$L6a\",\"kaja\",{\"href\":\"/heroes/kaja\",\"className\":\"group block\",\"children\":[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"relative bg-surface-4 border border-mlbb-gold/20 overflow-hidden card-hover hover:border-mlbb-gold/50\",\"style\":{\"boxShadow\":\"0 2px 8px rgba(0,0,0,0.3)\"},\"children\":[[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"flex items-center gap-3 p-3\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\